msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Ci "
"siamo conosciuti tre anni fa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9E82BD39_962D_4B8B_AD8C_456D380AEBC1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd50ee794f7d2596e7fc8577e47b93208e312c15cdbc275ae7637f8e8480d266
