msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9E82BD39_962D_4B8B_AD8C_456D380AEBC1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I thought for sure I would get burnt"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Pensavo che mi sarei bruciata di sicuro"

#: scenario2:scenario2_6E0919BF_7CA9_41E4_A5E1_8827B1C7E69F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad2a680feb01dea067937ac61058e156df6fb6ca71e1ae28abd318b559ea95be
#. default-sha256: b793ced97ef062007c25dec2c07bb16bf448c77b3174d79c5daed08b01c4d386
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6E0919BF_7CA9_41E4_A5E1_8827B1C7E69F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫sitting beneath the hellishly pounding sun⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫on that sweltering summer day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫seduta sotto il sole cocente⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫di quella soffocante giornata d’estate."

#: scenario2:scenario2_995BF6DF_D742_4CF8_947F_12E82EAC6804
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecc0cbb0c976d8f3918b52cf59de81ae6e017ef0d2a271650d11c221cdac8bad
#. default-sha256: bfd6bcd29b908fe45963e9fa34ff6ad289298ceb08c5bc73408afe5adffd977e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_995BF6DF_D742_4CF8_947F_12E82EAC6804"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s only ever on days such as those⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫that we end up having lunch outside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Era sempre e solo in giornate così⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫che finivamo per pranzare fuori."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2CB60A18_9FD7_4795_B2D0_05EDFC4001B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a331bc6e3e02f8538c86f5cf1e5812cad51c00f017505576dc0036a5184b43ef
