msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CFD43D05_666D_4CA7_A856_FF12D3099C17"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I could hear the cry of seagulls from the restaurant’s terrace."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dal terrazzo del ristorante potevo udire le grida dei gabbiani."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1E8DEAC5_3FD8_4F83_89B7_1E384764178A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b95dc338e7a3861e609afe56766f7067fc2a858adf1f4b7f4e4ec1d348b6fccd
#. default-sha256: b1b22ed2a05e755a36ed1f84356afab0073202c1ef9772b598195d982fd60245
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1E8DEAC5_3FD8_4F83_89B7_1E384764178A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I remember that day clear as crystal."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ricordo quel giorno come se fosse ieri."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E78553CD_4C95_4319_A3B1_62E2A964DE0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a079f6e030e1b67bac5421d492e369f6c5f55abc32f9f2e2dd3821209f6a984
#. default-sha256: 93acb77271599d4d7b394625cc2204f6f528db22dfb7cf20273d527098a750ab
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E78553CD_4C95_4319_A3B1_62E2A964DE0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Ah, yes, I have to say, the food here is ⟪k:10⟫"
"spectacular⟪k:11⟫.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫And I love that they give you so much meat.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Though I "
"thought my gut’d explode the first time I saw it, hahaha!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Ahh... devo ammetterlo, il cibo qui è ⟪k:10⟫"
"squisito⟪k:11⟫.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫E guarda quanta carne ti portano, è fantastico.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Anche se la "
"prima volta che ho visto portate tanto enormi⟪k:16⟫ho pensato che la pancia mi sarebbe esplosa, "
"hahaha!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_525F4CC9_9163_4241_937D_1FD6C484547A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d205f1bab8ef5f94ebc38d2cc3d4878096e2c9d3c429f74f02d0caa555562d6c
#. default-sha256: aa8e7b27801f2304762ae6fc40990d5d9de302fba8c5113cefd1bc5db9abc5a8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_525F4CC9_9163_4241_937D_1FD6C484547A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Wouldn’t you say, son?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Cosa ne pensi, figliolo?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D464456B_1CBE_4740_ABA9_72C051D28144
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0548a39347272fb2ced31c501930ec70f00b9cf082a086b31a5143610f76ce9
#. default-sha256: cc1e3b535d5f716b39c16baf94243e74addaf0d8c738b20dd79151b8e2d6e737
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D464456B_1CBE_4740_ABA9_72C051D28144"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I-⟪k:3⟫Indeed... ⟪k:4⟫Yes, it is."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫G-⟪k:3⟫Già... ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫È⟪k:6⟫ tutto squisito."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3A8CFF89_3E95_459A_8AC8_A88B0B6A63BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28c06631ea7f6d964996d1b7811744f8d7ecc32bf0b49bc39319306740488a1c
#. default-sha256: 5acf4acc6e602da892564d842b5069ccf8975954321a28f833794272cb12377f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3A8CFF89_3E95_459A_8AC8_A88B0B6A63BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫By the look on your face, I’d say you’re already feeling it?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You’re not "
"going to make it in this line of work⟪k:5⟫without a big ol’ stomach, son."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dalla tua faccia si direbbe che sei già pieno, eh?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Non riuscirai mai in "
"questo tipo di lavori⟪k:5⟫senza uno stomaco bello grosso, figliolo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2A7C51CE_E8BA_4D7C_A856_C5029C21AFEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
