msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2A7C51CE_E8BA_4D7C_A856_C5029C21AFEF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Heh... ⟪k:2⟫hahaha."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hah... ⟪k:2⟫hahaha."

#: scenario2:scenario2_80C3940B_11E4_4E06_9951_89B2F8319147
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d1a2f3dfa075b1e71da0f29399348d1a8447aeb6b1c7e22ad92cfe7e9088d03
#. default-sha256: 6b23ea5eef1e84405d6996f584e944151b8faacfb45489f59e2777e39841c173
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_80C3940B_11E4_4E06_9951_89B2F8319147"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m a huge fan of this country’s food."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sono un grande appassionato del cibo di questo Paese."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1DD2EEC4_9504_480C_A032_69636D6B850E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89db7f771970049bf4e29377fb5fea8d88310c107018cc9b6a2e38e3786096e2
#. default-sha256: 7c98ed10ec7a336bc4dab1e389edad49dbae71b4796c4577ac450e1d9799aa65
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1DD2EEC4_9504_480C_A032_69636D6B850E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One taste and you never forget it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’d like to bring the entire cuisine back with "
"me if I could."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Basta un solo assaggio e non lo dimentichi più.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se potessi, mi porterei dietro "
"l’intera cucina."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CB4A3C35_AE7C_42D8_97AB_998B740FD2DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4494120f408b0fe51aa207ee4a769a89fb43c5dbeec7b9d4a50ba05230dac0e8
#. default-sha256: f27732344b80a3ce55a537d44c88e20b714c5ba6d1c1a172a3250cad44dd9251
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CB4A3C35_AE7C_42D8_97AB_998B740FD2DE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is the first time we’ve seen you in how long,⟪k:1⟫and you’re talking about ⟪k:2⟫"
"food⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The first thing you asked when you arrived was,⟪k:6⟫“Is the restaurant by the "
"seaside still open?” for goodness’ sake."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non ci rivediamo dopo non si sa quanto tempo,⟪k:1⟫e la prima cosa di cui parli è il ⟪k:2⟫"
"cibo⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫La prima cosa che hai chiesto appena sei arrivato è stata:⟪k:6⟫“Il ristorante "
"sul litorale è ancora aperto?”, per l’amor del cielo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5D22588D_23FA_4C4A_BEEA_9AA2867028FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8bac8d3392f1143a3661f3a49d2b49b302f7ea271b291b071d7402d401df0cc6
#. default-sha256: cb9374101449d2fa59fd17b909852e7cdbb931c1fab59dd66c871d6925770569
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5D22588D_23FA_4C4A_BEEA_9AA2867028FE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is your heart made out of stone?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Hai proprio un cuore di pietra."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9350C4B7_9DA2_40C4_BA44_66C0764FDCCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4132638c6c963d812bf2073856f974038d9dd182f6431e7b7191ce8507a5c5d
#. default-sha256: e3fa472cd289e33a725c998efa4946a8b7e95b73d2c7ba1174076b427692a7a3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9350C4B7_9DA2_40C4_BA44_66C0764FDCCA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What, would you prefer we discuss the mundane?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why don’t we talk about market "
"developments and our spices inventory?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cosa, preferisci parlare di roba noiosa e banale?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perché non parliamo degli "
"sviluppi del mercato⟪k:3⟫o del nostro inventario di spezie, allora?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9270F5AA_73DF_4E06_B990_CAA0DAE3F39B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9d8486246a5812d8458d5969f9028bb0b50490952a3d9ac37f14da068fcb4fe
#. default-sha256: 2099b4d643ab7d56d1cb935c3a8f2d41cc3330484edda1fe0cdd8dadb7ddc805
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9270F5AA_73DF_4E06_B990_CAA0DAE3F39B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That’s not what I meant!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non è questo che intendevo!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_8CB2E2B1_B83D_435B_B406_C5A1239B2153
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f738835e300023f93022016d6a4f11c51ee2d67769f4731f0a599ec81c4b7243
